  "arrangerNotes": "The American tune (Effie Crockett's), verified against the second LilyPond score on German Wikipedia (the first score there is a different tune). 6/8 time (eighth = 0.5 beat). No simplification needed. D drum: as written (range low 3 to 4), D minLayout 15. C drum: the C drum has no low 3/4, so every low 3 and low 4 ('Rock' and 'on' in the first line, 'When' at the start of the second and third lines, and 'the' before 'cradle will fall') is played one octave higher; C minLayout 11. C and D arrangements differ where noted above (each fits its own drum).",
